# Fetch vs Pull

## Git Fetch

```bash
git fetch
```

* Downloads latest changes
* Does NOT merge changes

## Git Pull

```bash
git pull
```

* Downloads latest changes
* Automatically merges changes

```text
git pull = git fetch + git merge
```

### Interview Answer

Git fetch downloads changes from remote repository without merging them, whereas git pull downloads and merges changes automatically.

