# Pull Request (PR)

A Pull Request is used to merge code from one branch to another branch.

```text
feature/login
      ↓
Pull Request
      ↓
develop
```

### Benefits

* Code Review
* Quality Check
* Team Collaboration

### Interview Answer

A Pull Request is a request raised by a developer to merge changes from one branch into another branch after code review approval.

