# Merge vs Rebase

## Merge

```bash
git merge feature-login
```

* Preserves history
* Creates merge commit

## Rebase

```bash
git rebase develop
```

* Cleaner history
* Rewrites commit history

### Interview Answer

Merge preserves complete branch history, whereas rebase creates a cleaner linear history by rewriting commits.

