```

### Hard Reset

```bash
git reset --hard HEAD~1
```

### Revert vs Reset

| Revert                  | Reset          |
| ----------------------- | -------------- |
| Safe                    | Risky          |
| Creates New Commit      | Removes Commit |
| Used in Shared Branches | Used Locally   |

