# Top Git & GitHub Interview Questions

### What is Git?

Distributed version control system.

### What is GitHub?

Cloud platform for Git repositories.

### What is a Pull Request?

Request to merge code between branches.

### What is Git Stash?

Temporary storage for uncommitted changes.

### Difference Between Fetch and Pull?

Fetch downloads only; Pull downloads and merges.

### Difference Between Revert and Reset?

Revert creates new commit; Reset rewrites history.

### What is Git Conflict?

Occurs when Git cannot merge changes automatically.

### Difference Between Merge and Rebase?

Merge preserves history; Rebase creates linear history.

### What is .gitignore?

File used to exclude files from Git tracking.

### What is Fork?

Copy of another repository into your GitHub account.

### What is GitHub Actions?

CI/CD service provided by GitHub for build, test, and deployment automation.
